tor","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids came in under 90% of normal in September to October 40 times in 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle, August to September ran 53% of normal and November to December 50%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 50% on the middle. All 8 grids had their driest year in 1965, with grid 23018 at 59%.</p>"}
